WEBVTT

01:25.910 --> 01:31.610
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.200 --> 01:39.569
[Episode 34: A Critical Moment]

02:14.030 --> 02:18.030
It was you who brought Kang Qiao into the sect.

02:18.710 --> 02:21.470
And you've worked together for many years.

02:21.969 --> 02:24.750
I know how close you two were.

02:26.390 --> 02:28.750
But the dead can't come back to life.

02:29.540 --> 02:31.180
Don't let grief get the better of you.

02:32.110 --> 02:34.150
With his reckless nature,

02:35.140 --> 02:39.070
this was going to happen sooner or later.

02:40.080 --> 02:42.440
Kang Qiao is not exactly qualified,

02:43.600 --> 02:48.550
but he may be buried in Beishan Cemetery.

02:50.650 --> 02:52.850
It's OK, Master.

02:53.390 --> 02:55.300
The dead are dead.

02:55.810 --> 02:58.800
Funerals are just for the living.

02:59.210 --> 03:00.980
I don't care about those things.

03:02.700 --> 03:04.500
Let's keep it simple.

03:12.540 --> 03:14.070
Mo Bufan,

03:14.190 --> 03:16.330
if you have a grievance,

03:18.030 --> 03:20.180
why can't you be frank about it?

03:21.870 --> 03:23.530
I have no grievance.

03:25.670 --> 03:28.290
Kang Qiao had it coming to him.

03:32.670 --> 03:34.780
You don't need to console me.

04:23.030 --> 04:24.166
Your Highness.

04:24.190 --> 04:26.246
It's just the death of a nobody.

04:26.270 --> 04:28.370
Why bother consoling him personally?

04:30.440 --> 04:32.910
What was the order that I gave you?

04:33.020 --> 04:34.826
To get rid of Zhong Beidou

04:34.850 --> 04:36.350
as a warning to others.

04:36.450 --> 04:39.090
But why did you draw so much attention to it?

04:40.230 --> 04:41.680
You see, Your Highness,

04:41.870 --> 04:43.726
if it's meant as a warning to others,

04:43.750 --> 04:45.870
why shouldn't we draw attention to it?

04:47.230 --> 04:48.710
Besides, I also deliberately

04:48.710 --> 04:50.916
lured Kou Yuanjie in.

04:50.940 --> 04:53.510
The Kou family will make a decision soon.

04:54.380 --> 04:55.830
Nangong Fang,

04:56.100 --> 04:59.040
you and Yun Xiang are equally talented.

04:59.160 --> 05:00.766
But you're too confident.

05:00.790 --> 05:04.720
You'll get yourself into trouble if you go on like this.

05:56.260 --> 05:58.170
You're here to talk me out of it too?

06:05.910 --> 06:07.720
Do you really have to do this?

06:14.550 --> 06:16.240
It's indeed very cowardly

06:17.550 --> 06:19.270
to die in such a way.

06:23.950 --> 06:26.280
But I can see no way out.

06:29.840 --> 06:33.840
Or maybe you could help me find one?

06:44.590 --> 06:48.470
It's my determination to right past wrongs

06:48.670 --> 06:50.170
that's got me through these years.

06:51.400 --> 06:52.850
I'm not like you.

06:54.790 --> 06:56.880
You can live on your determination.

06:57.910 --> 07:02.410
But the hatred inside me has burned all my internal organs.

07:03.070 --> 07:05.040
I'd rather die.

07:09.540 --> 07:14.110
If we work together, we can save people from disasters.

07:14.310 --> 07:16.430
Isn't that a reason for living on?

07:21.550 --> 07:23.330
That day in the mountains,

07:24.310 --> 07:27.150
you told me you knew who Master was

07:28.430 --> 07:31.200
and wanted me to join you in foiling his plot.

07:32.180 --> 07:33.890
I agreed then

07:35.430 --> 07:37.100
for the sake of Yuntai.

07:38.270 --> 07:43.810
But now I am utterly disappointed in Yuntai

07:45.350 --> 07:47.140
and have no desire to fight.

07:51.070 --> 07:53.110
Fine. You don't have to do anything.

07:53.210 --> 07:54.686
We don't need to work together.

07:54.710 --> 07:56.525
Just live on.

07:56.549 --> 07:57.736
OK?

07:57.760 --> 08:00.100
Do you really think Master trusts you?

08:01.010 --> 08:02.686
You think he knows nothing about

08:02.710 --> 08:04.540
your dealings with Liu Gongquan?

08:04.760 --> 08:07.430
If he has the slightest suspicion about you,

08:08.110 --> 08:09.580
you can't expect him

08:10.170 --> 08:12.060
to spare your life at a critical moment.

08:12.280 --> 08:13.840
You think I don't know that?

08:15.660 --> 08:18.190
It's precisely because I know there's no turning back

08:19.170 --> 08:21.240
that I keep on going forward.

08:35.990 --> 08:37.589
Drink it up,

08:38.870 --> 08:41.230
and let our friendship in Nandu

08:43.590 --> 08:45.280
end here.

09:09.550 --> 09:11.810
Out of all the fellow disciples at Yuntai,

09:12.590 --> 09:15.260
you are the only one that I can trust now.

09:16.060 --> 09:17.630
I won't let you die.

09:18.540 --> 09:20.000
You must live.

09:22.410 --> 09:23.860
For you,

09:27.040 --> 09:28.600
I'll live for a few more days.

09:36.760 --> 09:38.166
You're such a fool.

09:38.190 --> 09:40.976
Why did you meddle in Yuntai's affairs?

09:41.000 --> 09:42.216
I rendered a great service.

09:42.240 --> 09:43.980
Why are you scolding me again?

09:44.280 --> 09:46.426
Nangong Fang knew you were eager to render a great service,

09:46.450 --> 09:47.376
so he used you as a weapon

09:47.400 --> 09:48.850
to warn others.

09:49.470 --> 09:50.926
Zhong Beidou absconded.

09:50.950 --> 09:52.710
Prince Fu wasn't going to keep him anyway.

09:52.760 --> 09:53.816
Since we were going to join forces,

09:53.840 --> 09:55.616
I did that to show our sincerity to Prince Fu.

09:55.640 --> 09:57.090
What's wrong with that?

09:57.220 --> 09:59.446
Who said I'd decided to join forces with them?

09:59.470 --> 10:01.206
Do we have any other option?

10:01.230 --> 10:02.846
Lingyuan has become the way it is now

10:02.870 --> 10:04.666
all because of your indecisiveness!

10:04.690 --> 10:06.140
Shut up!

10:06.290 --> 10:08.010
Don't let me see you again.

10:14.910 --> 10:16.686
It's my fault he's the way he is now,

10:16.710 --> 10:18.540
and I'm paying the penalty.

10:19.780 --> 10:20.956
Mother,

10:20.980 --> 10:23.040
Prince Fu will probably call us to account

10:23.470 --> 10:25.160
and force you to agree to join forces.

10:28.290 --> 10:30.030
Actually,

10:30.110 --> 10:32.560
joining forces isn't our only option.

10:34.660 --> 10:36.810
I know what you mean.

10:37.540 --> 10:39.296
But how can you be sure

10:39.320 --> 10:41.476
that Yun Xiang isn't here to spy on us

10:41.500 --> 10:43.686
on Prince Fu's order?

10:43.710 --> 10:44.726
Mother,

10:44.750 --> 10:45.686
I know our situation

10:45.710 --> 10:47.600
and am not being swayed by emotions.

10:47.660 --> 10:48.746
I trust him

10:48.770 --> 10:50.900
because I have considered the pros and cons

10:51.060 --> 10:53.140
as a member of Lingyuan and the Kou family.

11:09.770 --> 11:10.806
Father,

11:10.830 --> 11:12.396
I heard that those elders of the sect

11:12.420 --> 11:14.030
will be executed soon.

11:15.290 --> 11:16.576
Didn't you say

11:16.600 --> 11:18.886
you would handle this without bloodshed?

11:18.910 --> 11:20.086
Mingzhu,

11:20.110 --> 11:22.166
great undertakings entail sacrifices.

11:22.190 --> 11:23.640
We kill

11:23.710 --> 11:25.666
so that we won't have to kill in the future.

11:25.690 --> 11:26.976
So how many more people will die

11:27.000 --> 11:28.760
for the sake of your great undertaking?

11:29.160 --> 11:30.366
If this is how you do it,

11:30.390 --> 11:32.556
how are you different from those in the imperial government

11:32.580 --> 11:34.406
who purge dissidents for their selfish desires?

11:34.430 --> 11:35.880
How dare you!

11:39.290 --> 11:40.740
Mingzhu,

11:41.110 --> 11:42.100
I have explained to you

11:42.120 --> 11:44.296
what is at stake in all this.

11:44.320 --> 11:46.636
If I don't kill them now,

11:46.660 --> 11:49.050
won't we be giving them the opportunity to kill us?

11:49.740 --> 11:51.320
I'm afraid

11:52.640 --> 11:54.610
you're only going to see more killings

11:55.780 --> 11:58.060
in the days to come.

11:58.350 --> 12:00.410
Are we going to kill everyone

12:00.780 --> 12:02.810
who disagrees with us?

12:07.650 --> 12:09.100
Mingzhu,

12:11.550 --> 12:13.860
we are all flesh and blood.

12:14.740 --> 12:16.616
The more lives you take,

12:16.640 --> 12:18.800
the deeper you are in karmic debt.

12:19.110 --> 12:22.086
I'm only doing it because I have no choice.

12:22.110 --> 12:23.710
Do you think

12:24.040 --> 12:26.900
I am really a heartless person?

12:29.950 --> 12:31.570
Take Yun Xiang, for example.

12:32.830 --> 12:35.370
I know he has objections,

12:36.080 --> 12:38.040
but I'm not entirely willing

12:38.260 --> 12:40.160
to get rid of him.

12:41.420 --> 12:43.726
But Yun Xiang said that

12:43.750 --> 12:45.410
he would do his best to help.

12:48.510 --> 12:49.960
Mingzhu,

12:50.930 --> 12:53.686
don't ever believe what people say.

12:53.710 --> 12:55.506
He's claiming to be on my side

12:55.530 --> 12:57.870
in order to protect himself.

12:58.010 --> 12:59.690
You know that.

13:00.070 --> 13:02.850
He's close with Gongquan.

13:03.590 --> 13:05.366
How can I be sure

13:05.390 --> 13:07.230
that they're not hatching a conspiracy?

13:07.470 --> 13:09.320
Yun Xiang's life

13:09.430 --> 13:11.326
is as much in his hands as it's in mine.

13:11.350 --> 13:13.750
I'm sending him to Nandu this time

13:13.820 --> 13:16.370
to let him make his own choice.

13:25.340 --> 13:26.800
Your Highness, you wanted to see me?

13:27.910 --> 13:29.116
Yun Xiang,

13:29.140 --> 13:30.866
if my father sends you to Nandu,

13:30.890 --> 13:32.470
you must not refuse.

13:33.070 --> 13:36.040
Why is His Highness sending me to Nandu?

13:36.460 --> 13:39.000
I can't really give you any details.

13:39.300 --> 13:41.330
Anyway, remember what I said.

13:42.870 --> 13:44.400
It can save your life.

13:45.110 --> 13:46.070
If His Highness doesn't trust me,

13:46.090 --> 13:47.616
he can kill me.

13:47.640 --> 13:49.320
As a member of Yuntai,

13:49.360 --> 13:52.000
I have no place in this world.

13:52.110 --> 13:54.530
Please tell His Highness

13:54.660 --> 13:56.490
that I'm absolutely loyal to him.

13:57.050 --> 14:00.240
My father asked me to test you.

14:01.430 --> 14:03.660
Those who achieve great things in the world

14:04.050 --> 14:05.880
must sever their personal relationships

14:06.170 --> 14:08.366
and only keep the most trustworthy people by their side.

14:08.390 --> 14:09.516
That's normal.

14:09.540 --> 14:11.540
Those who aspire to achieve great things...

14:11.910 --> 14:13.360
Including you?

14:14.060 --> 14:15.386
Including me.

14:15.410 --> 14:16.860
I don't believe it.

14:17.750 --> 14:19.520
They all said

14:19.590 --> 14:21.656
you're unpredictable

14:21.680 --> 14:23.156
and evil.

14:23.180 --> 14:24.796
But as soon as I met you,

14:24.820 --> 14:27.000
I knew they were wrong about you.

14:27.380 --> 14:28.890
You're too kind, Your Highness.

14:29.460 --> 14:31.620
I was taught by Master himself.

14:56.980 --> 15:00.170
You mean the royal supplier selection

15:01.160 --> 15:01.846
is rigged?

15:01.870 --> 15:05.146
I'm now in charge of the affairs of Nandu Government Office.

15:05.170 --> 15:06.896
Why would I lie to you?

15:06.920 --> 15:08.730
But Advisor Xu...

15:11.270 --> 15:12.720
Lord Xu.

15:13.220 --> 15:15.506
I remember in the past the selection results

15:15.530 --> 15:17.096
were presented to His Majesty first,

15:17.120 --> 15:19.266
so that His Majesty could confer the title himself.

15:19.290 --> 15:20.116
Of course,

15:20.140 --> 15:21.776
I mean no disrespect.

15:21.800 --> 15:23.910
But how is Nandu Government Office

15:24.910 --> 15:26.950
able to rig the result?

15:27.110 --> 15:30.110
Well... Here's how it works.

15:34.470 --> 15:37.690
Mr. Su, are you close with Yun Xiang?

15:40.290 --> 15:43.230
If someone tries to make things difficult for you,

15:43.660 --> 15:45.406
be sure to tell him

15:45.430 --> 15:46.880
what I've just said.

15:49.460 --> 15:52.680
Yun Xiang is a business partner of ours.

15:53.500 --> 15:54.950
That's all?

15:55.420 --> 15:57.290
To be exact,

15:57.660 --> 16:01.130
Yun Xiang is our enemy and friend.

16:01.310 --> 16:04.186
He tends to use both tempting promises

16:04.210 --> 16:05.426
and threats

16:05.450 --> 16:07.970
to make me throw in my lot with him.

16:08.340 --> 16:09.446
Of course,

16:09.470 --> 16:11.400
although he's always taking advantage of us,

16:11.530 --> 16:15.050
we do manage to make a modest profit from it.

16:18.070 --> 16:19.520
I see.

16:20.970 --> 16:23.006
As befits a family of merchants,

16:23.030 --> 16:25.070
you know how to make the most of any situation.

16:25.420 --> 16:26.436
Lord Xu,

16:26.460 --> 16:29.820
maybe you could just tell Mr. Su?

16:30.550 --> 16:33.236
Appointing your family as the royal silk supplier

16:33.260 --> 16:35.810
is a generous gift from Prince Fu.

16:36.710 --> 16:39.550
But while it's a gift,

16:40.130 --> 16:42.530
you are expected to reciprocate.

16:46.140 --> 16:47.590
Right.

16:47.680 --> 16:49.130
Right.

16:52.140 --> 16:53.386
Be sure to do the thing

16:53.410 --> 16:55.726
that I've just asked you to as soon as possible.

16:55.750 --> 16:56.676
Remember,

16:56.700 --> 16:58.200
keep it a secret.

16:58.350 --> 16:59.306
People are orderly

16:59.330 --> 17:01.066
as long as merchants are.

17:01.090 --> 17:03.836
Your family is the leader of Nandu Chamber of Commerce.

17:03.860 --> 17:06.006
From now on, no matter what you hear

17:06.030 --> 17:07.356
or see,

17:07.380 --> 17:10.129
you should always speak or act

17:10.219 --> 17:12.460
with caution.

17:12.660 --> 17:14.110
I will.

17:30.320 --> 17:31.596
Who are you?

17:31.620 --> 17:33.560
How dare you trespass on my property!

17:37.870 --> 17:40.750
Mr. Su, how have you been?

17:46.050 --> 17:48.050
What did Xu Qingwen tell you?

17:50.030 --> 17:52.416
I'm just a merchant

17:52.440 --> 17:54.116
running a normal business.

17:54.140 --> 17:56.000
Why am I getting visits

17:56.440 --> 17:58.730
from Nandu Government Office and Imperial Security Office

17:58.730 --> 18:00.236
within one day?

18:00.260 --> 18:02.730
Just answer the question.

18:05.210 --> 18:08.150
Yun Xiang told me a lot about you.

18:08.590 --> 18:11.530
Did he tell you to distance yourself from him

18:11.910 --> 18:13.960
before he left Nandu?

18:15.780 --> 18:17.820
Do you know Shao Yiheng is dead?

18:18.460 --> 18:20.330
So that's why it was Advisor Xu who came.

18:20.480 --> 18:22.926
How did Magistrate Shao die?

18:22.950 --> 18:25.170
The announcement says it's a sudden death caused by

18:25.310 --> 18:26.456
excessive drinking.

18:26.480 --> 18:27.806
It's probably not true.

18:27.830 --> 18:29.990
Prince Fu ordered to kill him.

18:30.130 --> 18:31.676
Not only Shao Yiheng,

18:31.700 --> 18:33.346
but all the officials in Nandu

18:33.370 --> 18:35.896
have been replaced by Prince Fu's men.

18:35.920 --> 18:37.370
You're right.

18:37.550 --> 18:39.860
It's indeed Prince Fu's rebellion.

18:40.850 --> 18:42.726
But I've joined forces with Yun Xiang

18:42.750 --> 18:44.396
in the hope of ending this turmoil.

18:44.420 --> 18:47.530
Otherwise, there'll be endless misery inflicted by war.

18:47.630 --> 18:49.396
Where is Yun now?

18:49.420 --> 18:51.210
He's with Prince Fu,

18:51.520 --> 18:53.146
trying to find out his plans for the rebellion

18:53.170 --> 18:56.480
and biding his time before we can work more closely together.

18:57.310 --> 18:58.956
In that case, isn't Yun...

18:58.980 --> 19:00.610
In great danger.

19:03.160 --> 19:04.296
My lord,

19:04.320 --> 19:06.320
we can't stay in the city for long.

19:06.590 --> 19:07.916
Mr. Su,

19:07.940 --> 19:10.580
as this is urgent, I'll be frank.

19:10.740 --> 19:13.540
If you accept Xu Qingwen's offer and participate in the rebellion,

19:13.650 --> 19:16.520
you'll most certainly die. So now...

19:16.830 --> 19:19.820
I'm giving you a chance to survive.

19:28.390 --> 19:30.036
I'm the young master of Lingyuan.

19:30.060 --> 19:31.900
How can you order me around?

19:34.570 --> 19:36.636
Are you really not going?

19:36.660 --> 19:39.160
I didn't kill Zhong Beidou alone.

19:45.160 --> 19:46.376
Young Master Kou,

19:46.400 --> 19:47.926
we're just passing the message.

19:47.950 --> 19:49.590
Why make things difficult for us?

19:51.740 --> 19:53.106
You saw it.

19:53.130 --> 19:54.446
Although I wounded Zhong Beidou,

19:54.470 --> 19:55.920
it wan't fatal.

19:56.130 --> 19:56.936
Besides,

19:56.960 --> 19:58.620
Xu Lang joined in as well.

19:58.720 --> 20:00.006
His Highness checked it himself.

20:00.030 --> 20:01.910
The stab you delivered was the fatal one.

20:07.850 --> 20:10.330
Yuntai's martial arts master died for nothing.

20:10.500 --> 20:12.570
If we ignore this,

20:13.050 --> 20:15.270
I'm afraid it'll disappoint our sect members.

20:15.940 --> 20:18.450
Yun, what do you think?

20:19.690 --> 20:21.410
I'll abide by Master's decision.

20:22.370 --> 20:23.806
Lingyuan has been slow

20:23.830 --> 20:26.020
to decide on joining forces.

20:26.230 --> 20:28.466
What does Madam Kou intend to do?

20:28.490 --> 20:29.940
I...

20:30.580 --> 20:32.270
I tried to persuade her many times.

20:32.420 --> 20:33.870
Young Master Kou,

20:34.260 --> 20:35.910
what else can we do to help you

20:36.310 --> 20:38.210
besides waiting?

20:41.620 --> 20:43.070
In that case,

20:43.310 --> 20:44.630
we'll do everything we can

20:44.630 --> 20:46.640
and use more bargaining chips.

20:52.350 --> 20:53.680
You only need Madam Kou's seal

20:53.680 --> 20:55.526
to have the branches at your disposal.

20:55.550 --> 20:57.090
I'll just steal it.

21:01.630 --> 21:03.900
W-Why are you laughing?

21:05.320 --> 21:06.766
Your Highness,

21:06.790 --> 21:08.606
I'm truly willing to join forces.

21:08.630 --> 21:10.770
I'm not the one who's trying to stall it.

21:10.830 --> 21:12.590
Why take it out on me?

21:13.350 --> 21:16.060
It's easy for you to steal the seal.

21:16.140 --> 21:19.536
But won't Yuntai be accused of instigating you?

21:19.560 --> 21:21.076
Even that won't work?

21:21.100 --> 21:22.956
Are you expecting me to usurp the position of Sect Master?

21:22.980 --> 21:24.460
Young Sect Master Kou...

21:27.470 --> 21:29.046
is indeed decisive.

21:29.070 --> 21:30.086
I...

21:30.110 --> 21:32.310
Let me see who's there!

21:32.770 --> 21:37.770
Go away!

21:44.560 --> 21:47.396
Kang Qiao and Mr. Zhong have just died,

21:47.420 --> 21:49.830
and you're having a good time here?

21:49.830 --> 21:50.916
Mr. Mo, you are drunk.

21:50.940 --> 21:52.390
Go away!

21:54.090 --> 21:57.260
You've really grasped the essence of Yuntai.

21:57.380 --> 21:59.100
No love or hatred.

21:59.570 --> 22:02.320
What a walking corpse!

22:04.590 --> 22:06.040
Mo Bufan,

22:06.400 --> 22:08.340
why are you doing this anyway?

22:08.740 --> 22:10.380
Who do you think you are?

22:11.070 --> 22:12.676
This is Yuntai's headquarters!

22:12.700 --> 22:14.770
What right do you have to sit here?

22:18.830 --> 22:21.136
Master ordered you to take charge of Yuezhou.

22:21.160 --> 22:22.806
You turned your nose up at that barren place

22:22.830 --> 22:24.400
and insisted on coming to Nandu.

22:24.750 --> 22:27.660
And what a mess you've made of Nandu.

22:27.700 --> 22:29.096
If I had known it would come to this,

22:29.120 --> 22:31.480
I would have reported it truthfully!

22:41.310 --> 22:42.760
Mo Bufan,

22:43.300 --> 22:44.750
you're drunk.

22:49.020 --> 22:50.470
Right.

22:51.190 --> 22:52.640
You're right.

22:52.870 --> 22:55.090
What difference would it have made?

22:56.550 --> 22:58.330
Because you lot

22:58.450 --> 23:00.980
were already colluding

23:01.200 --> 23:03.676
in playing this shady big game.

23:03.700 --> 23:06.486
But you kept the two of us in the dark!

23:06.510 --> 23:08.380
-Mr. Mo, let me take you back to rest. -Get lost!

23:09.790 --> 23:11.440
Stay away from me.

23:11.510 --> 23:13.040
Don't dirty me.

23:13.700 --> 23:15.880
What sacred place is this?

23:16.190 --> 23:19.050
You are all crooks!

23:24.410 --> 23:25.860
Prince Fu,

23:25.900 --> 23:28.460
you seriously want to usurp the throne?

23:30.800 --> 23:33.356
It's such a shame that despite all your schemes,

23:33.380 --> 23:35.076
you fail to see the fact

23:35.100 --> 23:37.220
that these people around you

23:37.450 --> 23:39.980
all have their own intentions.

23:41.970 --> 23:43.256
Him?

23:43.280 --> 23:45.760
How can he be willing to play second fiddle?

23:46.270 --> 23:47.556
Him?

23:47.580 --> 23:49.426
You think he's a good one?

23:49.450 --> 23:51.150
Do you know how close he is

23:51.150 --> 23:52.710
with the imperial guards?

23:52.870 --> 23:55.770
He can take your life in a flash.

23:59.290 --> 24:00.446
Let go of me!

24:00.470 --> 24:02.806
You're seemingly in agreement, but actually at odds.

24:02.830 --> 24:05.150
And you want to do big things?

24:17.720 --> 24:19.170
Young Master Kou.

24:22.410 --> 24:24.530
Stop making me wait.

24:32.210 --> 24:35.460
[To perch on bamboo]

24:36.870 --> 24:38.710
Joining forces concerns the lives

24:38.710 --> 24:41.190
of tens of thousands of members of Lingyuan.

24:41.870 --> 24:43.950
I have to be very cautious.

24:45.550 --> 24:47.430
I'll trust you this time.

24:49.940 --> 24:51.510
Mother, you've finally...

24:58.740 --> 25:00.430
Why are you giving the seal to her?

25:00.680 --> 25:02.316
What has she done for the sect in all these years?

25:02.340 --> 25:04.166
She's done better than you

25:04.190 --> 25:06.900
to have not made things worse.

25:07.080 --> 25:08.860
Have you really made up your mind?

25:09.020 --> 25:11.130
How many chances have I given you?

25:11.380 --> 25:13.810
You're just not cut out for it.

25:14.940 --> 25:16.390
Get out.

25:16.540 --> 25:18.690
I have things to discuss with your sister.

25:20.700 --> 25:22.150
Get out!

25:30.110 --> 25:32.430
Yuanjie is becoming increasingly irritable.

25:33.050 --> 25:34.860
It might be better not to provoke him.

25:37.110 --> 25:39.150
I deserve it.

25:40.340 --> 25:41.790
Lianyi,

25:42.300 --> 25:44.220
go to Yun Xiang

25:44.440 --> 25:47.160
and tell him what we have just discussed.

25:47.240 --> 25:48.690
OK.

26:00.510 --> 26:01.970
How is Mo Bufan?

26:08.530 --> 26:09.980
Mr. Mo?

26:10.590 --> 26:11.896
Get lost!

26:11.920 --> 26:13.370
Get lost!

26:13.880 --> 26:15.936
Mr. Mo, it's Yun Xiang.

26:15.960 --> 26:18.710
I'll kill you if you come in!

27:03.920 --> 27:05.506
My mother has agreed to dispatch Lingyuan's branches

27:05.530 --> 27:07.210
according to your plan.

27:07.370 --> 27:09.950
I think we're halfway there.

27:10.450 --> 27:13.076
I heard that the Yuntai members who were trying to escape

27:13.100 --> 27:14.680
are now locked up in the dungeon.

27:15.230 --> 27:17.320
Will Prince Fu let Mr. Mo off?

27:18.800 --> 27:20.250
It's impossible.

27:23.460 --> 27:25.460
Mr. Mo is now hell-bent on killing himself.

27:25.590 --> 27:28.540
But I'm going to save him, come what may.

27:33.360 --> 27:35.080
I have an idea.

27:38.510 --> 27:39.486
Very good.

27:39.510 --> 27:40.806
This way

27:40.830 --> 27:43.066
I'll be able to get Mr. Mo out of the headquarters

27:43.090 --> 27:44.960
under the pretext of taking him back to his hometown.

27:45.170 --> 27:48.456
It will also help me solve a big problem.

27:48.480 --> 27:49.336
What problem?

27:49.360 --> 27:51.526
I've actually always wondered

27:51.550 --> 27:53.246
how they deployed the pirates.

27:53.270 --> 27:55.060
As things stand,

27:55.190 --> 27:57.076
I'll have to use Nangong Fang,

27:57.100 --> 28:00.380
for only he can get in touch with Master Guan.

28:01.750 --> 28:04.990
You want to do the same with Nangong Fang

28:05.040 --> 28:06.556
and get him out as well?

28:06.580 --> 28:08.030
That's right.

28:09.460 --> 28:11.520
But to use Nangong Fang,

28:12.250 --> 28:14.290
I'll need your help.

28:26.150 --> 28:27.600
As usual,

28:29.950 --> 28:31.430
just trust me.

28:33.640 --> 28:36.520
Why does this feel so familiar?

28:37.040 --> 28:39.286
From start to finish, you give the orders,

28:39.310 --> 28:40.760
and I carry them out.

28:41.620 --> 28:45.350
I miss this feeling so much.

28:50.070 --> 28:51.910
Does this feel familiar?

29:00.820 --> 29:02.166
Get lost!

29:02.190 --> 29:03.710
Don't be rude.

29:03.790 --> 29:05.240
Let him through.

29:12.460 --> 29:14.400
Judging from the look on your face,

29:14.700 --> 29:17.540
you didn't reach an agreement with Madam Kou, did you?

29:20.880 --> 29:22.560
Why don't you sit down and go into detail?

29:24.280 --> 29:27.890
Is Prince Fu going to keep his word?

29:28.400 --> 29:32.190
Which word are you talking about?

29:43.640 --> 29:47.566
I'll command Lingyuan.

29:47.590 --> 29:49.330
Congratulations, Master Kou.

29:50.830 --> 29:53.010
You've finally made up your mind.

30:16.780 --> 30:20.810
Advisor Xu must have come on Prince Fu's order,

30:22.070 --> 30:27.350
asking you to stock up on army provisions, cloth and minerals.

30:28.860 --> 30:31.400
But what did Lord Liu ask you to do?

30:31.880 --> 30:35.660
He asked me to pretend to help Xu Qingwen

30:36.110 --> 30:37.940
and stock up on military supplies,

30:39.060 --> 30:40.706
but then destroy them all

30:40.730 --> 30:42.790
and leave Prince Fu with an empty city.

30:44.260 --> 30:46.686
We have no choice.

30:46.710 --> 30:49.140
My family has been a royal supplier for over a century

30:49.450 --> 30:51.070
by the grace of His Majesty.

30:51.460 --> 30:54.440
We won't help Prince Fu stage a revolt.

30:56.820 --> 30:59.070
Nor will I sit by and watch this place

30:59.480 --> 31:01.150
become a living hell.

31:01.410 --> 31:02.860
Why...

31:03.660 --> 31:06.050
Why does all this feel so unreal?

31:06.260 --> 31:07.710
Indeed.

31:09.150 --> 31:10.940
Lord Liu also said

31:11.280 --> 31:12.840
that Yun told him

31:13.010 --> 31:14.030
not to get my family involved

31:14.030 --> 31:15.800
for any reason.

31:16.470 --> 31:18.856
But how can I stay out of it,

31:18.880 --> 31:20.410
holding a candle to the devil

31:20.900 --> 31:23.300
and watching the people of Nandu suffer from war?

31:25.130 --> 31:27.030
If we follow Lord Liu's plan,

31:28.300 --> 31:31.400
what are our chances of saving Mr. Yun?

31:31.870 --> 31:36.170
We lost everything and were able to start all over again.

31:36.340 --> 31:38.320
But now we're going against Prince Fu.

31:40.780 --> 31:42.930
I'm afraid we'll end up losing our lives.

31:47.920 --> 31:49.796
Xu Qingwen told you

31:49.820 --> 31:53.580
that Dafeng Bank's 400,000 taels of silver is at your disposal?

31:55.110 --> 31:57.220
If we're to cut off Prince Fu's retreat,

31:58.630 --> 32:01.640
we'll have to buy all the goods in Nandu?

32:01.670 --> 32:03.120
That's right.

32:04.220 --> 32:08.860
We'll have to leave absolutely nothing

32:09.440 --> 32:11.166
so as to defeat him completely.

32:11.190 --> 32:13.620
Four hundred thousand taels won't be enough.

32:14.880 --> 32:17.110
Maybe you'll even lose your...

32:18.670 --> 32:20.880
We have never betted like this before.

32:21.490 --> 32:22.980
Since it's a bet,

32:24.420 --> 32:26.070
the result is uncertain.

32:30.340 --> 32:32.400
Follow your heart.

32:45.270 --> 32:46.720
I'm so lucky

32:48.880 --> 32:50.330
to have you.

33:14.430 --> 33:15.880
What are you

33:16.130 --> 33:17.820
going to do with this wine?

33:18.520 --> 33:19.970
It's poisoned.

33:22.920 --> 33:24.760
There are 4 people in the dungeon,

33:24.950 --> 33:26.630
but there are 5 cups.

33:29.110 --> 33:32.126
What you've said to me since your return,

33:32.150 --> 33:34.430
to what extent is it true, or false?

33:34.800 --> 33:38.540
It's as true as it's false.

33:39.510 --> 33:43.350
To what extent was what Mo Bufan said true, or false?

33:45.020 --> 33:46.470
I think

33:46.590 --> 33:48.870
you know it better than me, Master.

33:54.380 --> 33:55.830
It's a good thing

33:56.820 --> 33:59.960
you didn't give Liu Gongquan the location of our headquarters.

34:00.870 --> 34:04.680
Otherwise he would have been ambushed and killed.

34:04.720 --> 34:07.730
Yuntai gave me a second chance at life.

34:08.160 --> 34:10.519
I will never betray the sect.

34:12.870 --> 34:15.870
I'm going to Yangzhou tomorrow to reorganize the troops.

34:16.830 --> 34:18.990
Are you going with me?

34:21.220 --> 34:24.140
Yangzhou and Nandu are both important cities.

34:24.390 --> 34:26.410
I wonder what we're going do about Nandu.

34:29.560 --> 34:31.760
I'm leaving the headquarters soon.

34:33.140 --> 34:35.280
I shall not leave any chance

34:36.560 --> 34:38.479
for those who've betrayed me to exploit.

34:41.740 --> 34:43.190
Come in.

35:14.070 --> 35:16.320
You must have guessed

35:16.550 --> 35:18.980
who this is for.

35:19.750 --> 35:21.550
You two are close.

35:22.880 --> 35:24.880
Bid him farewell.

35:56.590 --> 35:59.030
[Prince Fu]

36:18.900 --> 36:20.350
There you are.

36:25.550 --> 36:28.140
This is "Flower of Death."

36:28.620 --> 36:30.130
Flower of Death?

36:31.050 --> 36:34.140
One will look pale and bleed after drinking it.

36:38.750 --> 36:41.886
This here will make you look dead,

36:41.910 --> 36:43.690
and it will last for 3 days.

36:44.410 --> 36:47.480
I'll find a way to get you out then.

36:47.820 --> 36:52.130
Will I look as if I've taken Flower of Death?

36:52.970 --> 36:54.536
Just drink it.

36:54.560 --> 36:56.010
I'll take care of the rest.

36:59.700 --> 37:02.170
You always think you're smarter than anyone else.

37:03.420 --> 37:04.576
Yun Xiang,

37:04.600 --> 37:06.120
it's cold in here.

37:06.310 --> 37:08.110
Warm it for me.

37:08.390 --> 37:09.846
Would you like a green plum in it?

37:09.870 --> 37:11.320
Sure.

37:15.790 --> 37:19.100
Not a bad mood for someone whose life is at stake.

37:29.010 --> 37:30.750
Mr. Mo!

37:37.560 --> 37:39.370
Why do you have to do this?

37:41.830 --> 37:43.280
You fool.

37:44.580 --> 37:46.860
Master is testing you.

37:47.720 --> 37:49.880
If you make any mistake,

37:50.430 --> 37:52.360
you'll die.

37:55.730 --> 37:57.380
I'll keep Kang Qiao company.

38:00.190 --> 38:02.560
I've finally tricked you once.

38:06.430 --> 38:08.490
Why do you have to do this?

38:13.220 --> 38:15.270
It's the last thing I can do for you.

38:20.910 --> 38:22.360
Hang in there.

38:22.990 --> 38:24.440
You're not like them.

38:25.050 --> 38:29.290
You, Luo Wenjia, will follow the way of Yuntai.

38:32.830 --> 38:34.280
I'm off.

38:35.920 --> 38:37.370
Don't cry.

40:12.510 --> 40:13.386
Your Highness,

40:13.410 --> 40:14.860
Mo Bufan is dead.

40:24.370 --> 40:25.546
Looks like

40:25.570 --> 40:27.270
Yun Xiang is someone we can trust.

40:41.540 --> 40:43.020
What can I do for you?

40:43.260 --> 40:46.216
I have something important to discuss with you.

40:46.240 --> 40:49.110
And you must come alone.

40:49.660 --> 40:51.110
Please.

41:38.230 --> 41:39.436
You brought me here

41:39.460 --> 41:41.530
to talk about joining forces, right?

41:43.270 --> 41:45.376
Lingyuan and Yuntai have the same root,

41:45.400 --> 41:47.240
but we've also been apart for over a century.

41:47.270 --> 41:48.100
If we can help

41:48.120 --> 41:50.820
bring the two sects together,

41:51.350 --> 41:54.310
maybe we'll realize this old ambition of our ancestors'.

41:55.220 --> 41:56.680
This wasn't necessary.

41:56.950 --> 41:59.100
Madam Kou has already agreed to join forces.

42:03.650 --> 42:05.790
I had a whole speech prepared.

42:05.820 --> 42:07.940
But that's great to hear.

42:08.590 --> 42:12.530
We'll drink to the alliance then.

42:25.990 --> 42:27.970
Actually,

42:28.160 --> 42:31.410
joining forces isn't the most important thing to me.

42:33.170 --> 42:34.326
Of course not.

42:34.350 --> 42:36.046
It's only a beginning.

42:36.070 --> 42:37.216
How can someone as ambitious as you

42:37.240 --> 42:39.600
be happy to keep playing second fiddle to Prince Fu?

42:40.560 --> 42:42.360
Please don't make fun of me.

42:54.910 --> 42:57.706
But it's true that there is something

42:57.730 --> 43:00.210
that's been bothering me.

43:00.990 --> 43:03.350
I wonder what it is about Yun Xiang,

43:03.350 --> 43:04.686
my fellow disciple,

43:04.710 --> 43:06.880
that makes Master favor him.

43:07.960 --> 43:09.410
And it's not just Master,

43:09.860 --> 43:12.000
but even you favor him, don't you?

43:13.180 --> 43:14.740
What do you want?

43:18.580 --> 43:21.470
Back when I was begging you to marry me,

43:22.350 --> 43:23.750
you chose to leave Lingyuan

43:23.750 --> 43:25.500
just to turn me down.

43:27.090 --> 43:29.640
I haven't been able to get over it.

43:36.730 --> 43:40.800
You're helping me take over the position of Sect Master.

43:40.970 --> 43:43.190
I should return the favor.

43:46.470 --> 43:50.086
Let me help you with what's between you

43:50.110 --> 43:51.780
and my sister.

43:57.280 --> 43:58.760
Heart Devouring Powder?

44:02.500 --> 44:05.970
Why don't we get intimate today

44:06.080 --> 44:08.066
to celebrate the alliance?

44:08.090 --> 44:09.540
Don't you dare!

44:46.060 --> 44:50.710
I'm actually not that interested in you.

44:53.820 --> 44:56.060
What really interests me is,

44:57.160 --> 45:00.550
when Yun Xiang learns that you've become my woman

45:00.810 --> 45:02.540
and have been under me,

45:03.640 --> 45:05.640
how is he going to feel about it?
